# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the tp4/sampler window (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it):
# copy it over .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/sampler and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN.
# Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a registry: the cards are resolved at run time. Every value is final.
# S0t: the BASELINE of the two timing jobs: c2-packed-tp4-speed itself (both verify audits OFF, the tail caps ON, no instruments, no stall watch, NO sampler flag) on
# the same image tp4-sampler-1 and the same tests as SPt and STt, so the arms' cost is read paired, on one image in one window under the same rig load:
# round time and coding decode rate of SPt and STt against this job's. Run it just before SPt and STt. Not a stop job.
# Duration (estimate): 25 min.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset smoke
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-sampler-1
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-speed
C2_SMOKE_TESTS=warmup,coding,concurrent4_code,concurrent4_code_equal,concurrent8_code
